    { q: "Talking on a hand-held phone while driving in New York is:", a: ["Illegal, with a fine and license points", "Legal if you're stopped at a light", "Legal for calls under one minute", "Legal outside NYC"], e: "It's a traffic infraction: up to $200 and 5 points for a first offense. Hands-free phones are allowed.", p: 52 }
